&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience or strong interest in:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude Code, Codex, and similar AI-assisted engineering tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MCP integrations and agent-based automation workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-assisted detection, triage, remediation support, and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
