&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who is excited about building modern identity security beyond traditional approaches and wants to help Scopely scale secure access across cloud, SaaS, AI, and engineering environments. If you enjoy solving IAM challenges with Terraform, automation, reusable engineering patterns, and well-designed identity systems, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
