&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategy, Systems &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
